":"movie","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/408197","fetchedAt":"2026-11-07T12:14:47.637Z","originalLanguage":"de-DE","title":{"value":"Marija","language":"de-DE"},"originalTitle":"Marija","overview":{"value":"Marija, a young Ukrainian woman, earns a living as a cleaning woman in a hotel in Dortmund, but dreams of having her own hairstyling salon, and puts away some money each month. But when she is fired without notice, her dream is suddenly postponed to an uncertain future. Jobless and under financial pressure, she is forced to look for alternatives but, in order to achieve her goal, she is ready to discard her body, her social relationships and her own feelings.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2016-08-08","status":"Released","rating":5.5,"ratingCount":10,"genres":["Dramma"],"countries":["Switzerland","Germany"],"facts":{"Runtime":"100m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1327624,"name":"Margarita Breitkreiz","role":"Marija","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/klu3WDpwCD12mG1fXC3EAiUxBwO.jpg"},{"id":40526,"name":"Georg Friedrich","role":"Georg","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fAlqZkiBB50B6xL5UK3b65f9Ddh.jpg"},{"id":1657217,"name":"Olga Dinnikova","role":"Olga","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Pkkv37aMpqGIEpMrLqfTfMeOSk.jpg"},{"id":1464147,"name":"Sahin Eryilmaz","role":"Cem","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j9s23nA1yWTY2tDjhhwRXKGtLqu.jpg"},{"id":1388771,"name":"Georges Devdariani","role":"Architekt","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4F4lPk49Lo4QlsvLIfsvLd7pYap.jpg"},{"id":1682840,"name":"Dmitri Alexandrov","role":"Igor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hJ6tfGoq9YKq1F8XgcamKgfWLbi.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","overview":"Marija, a young Ukrainian woman, earns a living as a cleaning woman in a hotel in Dortmund, but dreams of having her own hairstyling salon, and puts away some money each month. But when she is fired without notice, her dream is suddenly postponed to an uncertain future. Jobless and under financial pressure, she is forced to look for alternatives but, in order to achieve her goal, she is ready to discard her body, her social relationships and her own feelings."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Marija, eine junge Ukrainerin, verdient sich ihren Lebensunterhalt als Reinigungskraft in einem Hotel in Dortmund, träumt jedoch von einem eigenen Friseursalon. Monatlich legt sie etwas Geld beiseite, als eine fristlose Kündigung ihren Traum in weite Ferne rückt. Ohne Arbeit und finanziell unter Druck, sieht sie sich dazu gezwungen, nach anderen Möglichkeiten Ausschau zu halten. Dabei ist sie bereit, ihren Körper, ihre sozialen Beziehungen und zuletzt die eigenen Gefühle dem erklärten Ziel unterzuordnen. Das Spielfilmdebüt von Michael Koch ist das Portrait einer jungen Frau, die am Rand unserer Produktions- und Konsumgesellschaft lebt, sich jedoch nicht auf die ihr zugeschriebene Opferrolle reduzieren lässt. Fordernd, entschlossen und kompromisslos kämpft sie für ein freieres, selbstbestimmtes Leben."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n46k4fg9OQ6F5n5G2L7ZB7XoagS.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hW7kn6M80rOtZOlZyynXn1Je7Aw.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":408197,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l2yGm0QZlo4GSHVNTmbjTZVSnGY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l2yGm0QZlo4GSHVNTmbjTZVSnGY.jpg","language":"en","width":752,"height":1064},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l2yGm0QZlo4GSHVNTmbjTZVSnGY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l2yGm0QZlo4GSHVNT